  "details": "Even without a microphone attached, toggling the Face Mirror flashes activity on the microphone icon in the bottom left HUD when it shouldn't.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Set Mic Icon Position to \"Bottom Left\" or \"Both\" in the settings.\n\n2. Set Mic Icon Visibility to \"On Activity\" or \"When Muted\" (while muted).\n\n3. (Optional) Disconnect any microphones from the system.\n\n4. Press F4 or open the Face Mirror from the Action Menu.\n\nExpected result: The microphone icon should not flash activity on the HUD.\n\nActual result: The microphone icon flashes activity on the HUD.",
